License: MIT-or-compatible
 The release tarball vendors the third-party sources CoolProp builds
 against, so that a distribution build needs no network access.  Each
 vendored tree keeps its own licence file; see externals/cpm/<name>/ in
 the unpacked source.  None is linked into the shipped binary under terms
 more restrictive than the MIT licence above.

